# vhs tape for demo/demo-langsync.gif — run `vhs demo/demo-langsync.tape`
# from the repo root. Same sanitized stub as demo.tape.

Output demo/demo-langsync.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1120
Set Height 240
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=demo/bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "norcube langsync sync"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
